WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 20]

01:47.610 --> 01:48.460
Brother.

01:49.180 --> 01:51.140
Don't leave me.

02:27.700 --> 02:28.740
I've sent your stuff

02:28.740 --> 02:30.579
to the Waterside Pavilion for Reflections.

02:30.579 --> 02:32.240
Can you tell me the answer now?

02:32.540 --> 02:33.940
Who killed my master?

02:34.660 --> 02:36.370
Liu Shao and Immortal Luo Ge.

02:36.579 --> 02:37.579
Impossible.

02:38.860 --> 02:40.660
Do you want me to remind you about

02:40.900 --> 02:42.430
what happened on Luositai?

02:43.700 --> 02:45.900
Your master Lu Sheng was also involved.

02:51.860 --> 02:53.460
So you hate them too, right?

02:55.140 --> 02:55.870
Don't worry.

02:56.780 --> 02:58.260
I won't let them know

02:58.860 --> 03:00.790
there is demon energy in your body.

03:01.500 --> 03:04.030
You just need to come here once every two days.

03:05.170 --> 03:06.900
After all, the enemy of my enemy

03:08.860 --> 03:10.100
is my friend.

03:25.579 --> 03:26.460
What are these?

03:26.780 --> 03:28.140
These are the Weiyang flowers from yesterday.

03:28.140 --> 03:29.340
I tried to use magic

03:29.340 --> 03:30.170
to make a few.

03:30.170 --> 03:31.170
What do you think?

03:31.220 --> 03:32.350
Are they beautiful?

03:32.460 --> 03:34.500
Weiyang flowers will never wither.

03:34.740 --> 03:38.460
They symbolize that lovers will hold hands and be together forever.

03:38.460 --> 03:39.210
Can I

03:40.050 --> 03:41.500
put them here?

03:42.220 --> 03:42.700
Please.

03:45.340 --> 03:45.940
Whatever.

03:48.020 --> 03:49.950
Aren't you going to teach me magic?

03:51.340 --> 03:52.340
You can train your temperament

03:52.340 --> 03:54.260
with the Great Tone and Six Senses Symphony I gave you last time.

03:54.260 --> 03:55.260
But before that,

03:55.740 --> 03:58.000
I need to break through your Qihai first.

03:58.740 --> 03:59.780
Qihai?

04:05.690 --> 04:07.780
The vitality cultivated in the mortal world

04:07.780 --> 04:08.820
is no different from

04:08.820 --> 04:11.280
the spiritual power of the Immortal Palace.

04:11.820 --> 04:13.820
I'll break through the Qihai for you

04:13.940 --> 04:16.810
and guide the congested breath to form the spiritual flow.

04:16.810 --> 04:19.870
Then you can practice the magic of the Immortal Palace.

05:08.980 --> 05:09.580
Immortal.

05:10.300 --> 05:11.050
Are you okay?

05:12.780 --> 05:13.420
I'm fine.

05:18.940 --> 05:19.820
The bracelet

05:20.260 --> 05:22.260
removed some of the strength for you

05:22.810 --> 05:23.810
and protected you

05:24.380 --> 05:25.260
and me.

05:26.780 --> 05:28.510
But it was smashed into pieces.

05:29.380 --> 05:30.180
It's my fault.

05:31.900 --> 05:33.020
I broke the treasure

05:33.020 --> 05:34.180
Lu Li left you.

05:35.420 --> 05:36.950
I'll make it up to you later.

05:42.380 --> 05:43.980
As long as you're still here,

05:44.140 --> 05:45.090
everything else

05:45.980 --> 05:47.710
are just worldly possessions.

05:50.900 --> 05:52.630
The power of the Sun in your body

05:52.650 --> 05:53.710
is indeed special.

05:54.460 --> 05:56.140
I need to think about it carefully.

05:56.140 --> 05:57.140
The next few days,

05:57.180 --> 05:58.580
I have to be in seclusion.

05:58.659 --> 05:59.620
Go back and rest.

06:50.940 --> 06:52.740
What is this?

07:04.140 --> 07:05.400
Little Fairy Luo Ning.

07:05.940 --> 07:07.470
Although it's one day late,

07:07.540 --> 07:09.800
I still want to wish you a happy birthday.

07:11.060 --> 07:11.820
I am

07:12.060 --> 07:13.740
a smart man.

07:19.740 --> 07:20.940
You look

07:21.180 --> 07:22.420
ok.

07:22.860 --> 07:24.220
But you're still

07:24.380 --> 07:26.110
less handsome than my brother.

07:26.370 --> 07:28.020
But you are

07:29.090 --> 07:30.060
a little thin.

07:31.540 --> 07:32.460
You flatter me.

07:33.659 --> 07:35.320
You are quite thick-skinned.

07:35.380 --> 07:36.180
However,

07:36.580 --> 07:37.700
this is a merit,

07:38.270 --> 07:40.070
which is better than my brother.

07:40.340 --> 07:40.980
All right.

07:42.180 --> 07:43.130
Now,

07:43.420 --> 07:44.450
tell me.

07:45.060 --> 07:46.780
You tried so hard

07:47.340 --> 07:49.340
to send yourself to me.

07:50.100 --> 07:51.430
What's your intention?

07:52.100 --> 07:53.300
I'm just a prisoner.

07:54.180 --> 07:55.370
Although my body

07:56.100 --> 07:57.100
came to you

07:57.100 --> 07:58.560
through the water energy,

07:58.900 --> 08:00.580
my spirit is still locked up.

08:01.250 --> 08:02.900
My body is at the mercy of you.

08:03.020 --> 08:04.680
What bad intention can I have?

08:07.820 --> 08:09.250
So well said.

08:11.180 --> 08:12.700
For example,

08:13.140 --> 08:15.420
you can ask about the Immortal Palace

08:15.900 --> 08:17.140
and see if my brother

08:17.220 --> 08:18.380
has any weaknesses.

08:18.980 --> 08:20.220
And can I,

08:20.300 --> 08:21.380
a little fairy

08:21.460 --> 08:23.420
who never goes out

08:24.060 --> 08:25.300
and knows nothing about the world,

08:25.300 --> 08:27.090
be of any use to you?

08:28.180 --> 08:28.660
Right?

08:30.380 --> 08:31.700
You think too much.

08:32.220 --> 08:32.809
Look.

08:33.760 --> 08:36.100
I just felt lonely locked in the Waterside Pavillion,

08:36.100 --> 08:37.900
and wanted to play with someone.

08:38.940 --> 08:40.179
I like this reason.

08:42.010 --> 08:42.900
How about

08:43.260 --> 08:44.530
we play a game

08:44.780 --> 08:46.620
and see how long

08:46.820 --> 08:49.700
this water energy can sustain you?

09:00.140 --> 09:01.570
You're indeed thin.

09:09.130 --> 09:10.020
What?

09:10.100 --> 09:11.960
Immortal haven't recovered yet?

09:12.100 --> 09:14.060
I don't think he hasn't recovered from his old injury.

09:14.060 --> 09:16.620
But there is some problem with his cultivation.

09:16.620 --> 09:17.220
Look.

09:17.380 --> 09:18.380
He can't get rid of

09:18.660 --> 09:19.980
the poison from the Brahma Lotus.

09:19.980 --> 09:21.980
The sword wound hasn't recovered yet.

09:21.980 --> 09:25.060
He even injured himself when he helped me break through Qihai.

09:25.060 --> 09:26.500
He said he was fine.

09:27.210 --> 09:27.900
However,

09:28.020 --> 09:29.300
I think not only is he not okay,

09:29.300 --> 09:31.230
but his condition is also serious.

09:31.400 --> 09:33.620
It seems that after he became an Immortal,

09:33.620 --> 09:35.380
there seems to be something wrong with his cultivation.

09:35.380 --> 09:37.420
Is there something wrong with experiencing the tribulations?

09:37.420 --> 09:39.620
His energy and meridians were damaged.

09:39.980 --> 09:41.580
Is it because of Lu Li's half heart?

09:41.580 --> 09:42.820
I'm not sure.

09:43.180 --> 09:44.220
In fact, in these ten thousand years,

09:44.220 --> 09:46.260
there were only four or five Immortals.

09:46.260 --> 09:47.990
They all didn't live very long.

09:49.100 --> 09:50.460
Immortal Shang,

09:51.170 --> 09:53.580
Shang Yurong's father,

09:54.940 --> 09:56.540
was only an Immortal for 200 years.

09:56.540 --> 09:58.140
Then he died

09:58.140 --> 09:59.770
and never returned.

10:05.340 --> 10:06.090
This...

10:08.700 --> 10:09.830
Why are you running?

10:10.020 --> 10:11.950
I'm not going to do anything to you.

10:14.940 --> 10:17.380
Master Shang, how long have you been here?

10:17.820 --> 10:19.060
I've been sleeping on the tree.

10:19.060 --> 10:19.940
I didn't move.

10:43.220 --> 10:44.260
Don't worry.

10:44.500 --> 10:45.300
I

10:45.620 --> 10:46.780
was hurt by

10:46.780 --> 10:48.260
the magic weapon of Lu Sheng, the half demon.

10:48.260 --> 10:50.210
Later, when rebuilding the Protection Spell of the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke,

10:50.210 --> 10:51.580
I exhausted my spiritual power.

10:51.580 --> 10:52.700
That's why my injury recurred.

10:52.700 --> 10:54.740
I saw everything just now.

10:55.940 --> 10:57.940
The divine spirit in Liu Shao's body

10:58.300 --> 10:59.980
belongs to God of the Sun,

11:00.220 --> 11:02.150
which is extremely yang in nature.

11:02.180 --> 11:03.700
The power in your body

11:04.020 --> 11:06.580
belongs to God of the Moonlight, which is extremely yin in nature.

11:06.580 --> 11:07.700
You two

11:08.140 --> 11:09.580
are born mutually destructive.

11:09.580 --> 11:12.540
That's why you haven't recovered yet

11:12.540 --> 11:14.420
and are wearing out gradually.

11:14.580 --> 11:16.260
That's the real reason.

11:16.940 --> 11:18.460
With her ability,

11:18.740 --> 11:20.670
even if she has the power of the Sun,

11:20.820 --> 11:21.880
she can't hurt you.

11:23.020 --> 11:24.820
Are you afraid of hurting her?

11:30.500 --> 11:32.650
If you hadn't risked your life

11:32.780 --> 11:34.240
and retrieved your power,

11:34.460 --> 11:36.500
do you know what would've happened to her?

11:36.500 --> 11:38.760
Even with the lake beads protecting her,

11:39.540 --> 11:40.300
she will

11:41.940 --> 11:43.200
turn into broken bits.

11:57.140 --> 11:58.420
Why are you so nervous?

11:59.260 --> 12:00.060
Nothing.

12:00.990 --> 12:02.530
Are you still worried

12:02.540 --> 12:04.230
Luo Ge can't recover soon?

12:04.240 --> 12:06.040
He's an Immortal. He'll be fine.

12:06.740 --> 12:08.670
But if something happens to Luo Ge,

12:08.940 --> 12:10.610
you'll help him, right?

12:10.790 --> 12:11.610
That's right.

12:14.220 --> 12:14.890
But,

12:15.100 --> 12:16.780
can you give it back to me?

12:17.010 --> 12:19.070
This is my senior's favorite flower.

12:19.250 --> 12:20.950
Only one bloomed this year.

12:21.120 --> 12:22.380
I have to show it to her.

12:22.630 --> 12:22.970
Okay.

12:23.150 --> 12:23.580
Here.

12:24.260 --> 12:26.050
I won't ask you for it for nothing.

12:26.050 --> 12:26.940
This hairpin is

12:26.940 --> 12:28.000
my thank-you gift.

12:29.060 --> 12:30.120
What are you doing?

12:31.780 --> 12:32.460
Senior.

12:35.290 --> 12:35.860
Hairpin.

12:37.460 --> 12:37.940
Senior.

12:39.740 --> 12:40.380
Senior.

12:40.820 --> 12:42.880
Look at this flower. Is it beautiful?

12:44.380 --> 12:45.660
You are the master of the palace.

12:45.660 --> 12:46.700
Why are you playing with plants

12:46.700 --> 12:48.180
instead of cultivating?

12:48.300 --> 12:49.560
What are you thinking?

12:49.940 --> 12:50.540
Please spare my life.

12:50.540 --> 12:50.940
Stop!

12:51.220 --> 12:51.660
Stop!

12:51.660 --> 12:52.790
Senior, I was wrong.

12:53.180 --> 12:53.780
Stop!

12:54.660 --> 12:55.660
Please spare my life.

12:55.660 --> 12:58.660
Master Zhuo is so amazing.

13:04.340 --> 13:06.340
I have to return this hairpin to him.

13:08.220 --> 13:09.020
Not bad.

13:09.260 --> 13:10.520
Two hours have passed.

13:10.810 --> 13:11.820
Without the water energy,

13:11.820 --> 13:14.020
you have been holding on for a long time.

13:24.020 --> 13:24.450
You...

13:25.980 --> 13:26.980
What's wrong

13:27.300 --> 13:28.160
with your face?

13:30.980 --> 13:33.180
You have a thorough research on demons.

13:33.620 --> 13:35.540
Don't you know that although I can stay out of water,

13:35.540 --> 13:37.870
but I can't hold on for more than two hours?

13:38.740 --> 13:39.350
Yes.

13:39.700 --> 13:41.260
That seems to be the case.

13:42.420 --> 13:43.220
I'm sorry.

13:43.500 --> 13:44.210
I've been

13:44.540 --> 13:46.060
studying recently.

13:46.300 --> 13:47.770
I now have a bad memory.

13:50.380 --> 13:50.860
You...

13:51.770 --> 13:52.900
What's wrong?

13:54.660 --> 13:55.790
I don't look decent.

13:56.460 --> 13:56.940
Fairy.

13:58.260 --> 13:58.900
Excuse me.

13:59.860 --> 14:00.340
Hello?

14:01.380 --> 14:01.860
Hello?

14:06.220 --> 14:07.420
Although Fu

14:08.260 --> 14:09.390
is not a good person,

14:11.140 --> 14:12.140
he is

14:13.100 --> 14:14.770
quite interesting.

14:27.300 --> 14:28.300
Master,

14:29.020 --> 14:32.180
is this a medical book or a ghost painting?

14:32.700 --> 14:34.300
I don't know a word.

14:34.860 --> 14:35.900
My dear,

14:36.020 --> 14:37.350
this is the only copy left.

14:37.350 --> 14:38.620
I'll forgive you for being ignorant,

14:38.620 --> 14:40.780
but don't insult the words from my ancestors.

14:40.780 --> 14:41.910
Then you should keep

14:41.980 --> 14:43.580
the stuff from your ancestors for yourself.

14:43.580 --> 14:45.370
Why are you showing it to me? I don't understand.

14:45.370 --> 14:46.900
This ancient scroll records that

14:46.900 --> 14:49.830
Weirui Grass can help Immortal regain his vitality.

14:50.940 --> 14:52.260
Weirui Grass?

14:52.500 --> 14:54.900
It can bring infinite vitality to the body.

14:54.980 --> 14:56.060
When Luo Ge ascended,

14:56.060 --> 14:57.820
he needed to break through a lot of obstacles.

14:57.820 --> 14:59.820
There are some remaining problems.

14:59.820 --> 15:01.660
It can remould Luo Ge

15:01.660 --> 15:02.990
and let him feel reborn.

15:03.740 --> 15:06.460
Is it hard to find this grass?

15:07.740 --> 15:09.180
It's very hard to find.

15:09.530 --> 15:12.530
You may not be able to see it once in ten thousand years.

15:16.260 --> 15:18.100
But I'm the once-in-ten-thousand-years master.

15:18.100 --> 15:19.380
I have a seed of it.

15:21.370 --> 15:22.040
Really?

15:24.980 --> 15:26.300
Please don't tell me

15:26.540 --> 15:28.800
even there is seed, but you can't grow it?

15:29.290 --> 15:30.380
Actually,

15:30.660 --> 15:31.900
as long as someone can nurture it with

15:31.900 --> 15:33.290
the mediated extreme yin and yang energies,

15:33.290 --> 15:34.950
it will grow out in three days.

15:35.260 --> 15:36.500
But who can

15:36.620 --> 15:39.820
mediate the extreme yin and yang energies?

15:41.460 --> 15:42.140
Well...

15:42.140 --> 15:44.100
I know. I don't know.

15:44.500 --> 15:45.140
I know not.

15:47.860 --> 15:48.660
Master,

15:48.780 --> 15:49.700
you should throw the ancient book

15:49.700 --> 15:51.220
into the water.

15:52.100 --> 15:54.100
I thought the problem can be solved.

15:55.620 --> 15:56.900
There will be a way.

15:57.860 --> 15:58.980
Miss Liu Shao.

15:59.700 --> 16:01.300
Immortal Luo Ge summons you.

16:04.060 --> 16:04.980
Coming.

16:10.540 --> 16:11.580
What is this?

16:11.900 --> 16:13.160
This is the Ice Spirit.

16:14.420 --> 16:16.140
It can help you break through Qihai

16:16.140 --> 16:17.470
and become an Immortal.

16:21.380 --> 16:23.060
Ice Spirit.

16:24.100 --> 16:25.420
The spirit of ice

16:25.820 --> 16:27.480
comes from the softest water,

16:28.620 --> 16:30.750
and draws from the extreme yin energy.

16:31.820 --> 16:33.020
This mantra of heart

16:33.260 --> 16:36.520
is teaching me to mediate the extreme yang energy of the Sun

16:36.580 --> 16:39.620
with the extreme yin power.

16:40.180 --> 16:42.620
Could the spiritual energy cultivated with this mantra of heart

16:42.620 --> 16:44.420
the harmonious qi of yin and yang

16:44.580 --> 16:46.100
that Wan Sui mentioned?

16:57.100 --> 16:58.020
This mantra of heart is good.

16:58.020 --> 16:59.220
I will practice hard.

17:01.180 --> 17:02.180
Before that,

17:03.780 --> 17:04.900
drink this first.

17:06.569 --> 17:09.569
Is this a good thing for cultivating spiritual power?

17:10.500 --> 17:11.460
No need.

17:11.700 --> 17:12.819
I'm very healthy.

17:12.940 --> 17:14.180
You should keep such a good thing

17:14.180 --> 17:16.020
for yourself.

17:21.180 --> 17:22.440
This is Phoenix Tears.

17:23.339 --> 17:24.800
It's left by God of the Sun.

17:25.060 --> 17:26.540
What is it?

17:28.099 --> 17:29.540
After the phoenix's nirvana,

17:29.540 --> 17:30.870
it was reborn from fire.

17:31.060 --> 17:32.540
Before nirvana,

17:32.580 --> 17:34.260
it wept at the thought of the past.

17:34.260 --> 17:35.190
But from then on,

17:36.180 --> 17:37.340
a new life begins.

17:38.820 --> 17:41.350
So Phoenix Tears can help you forget the past.

17:41.980 --> 17:43.460
It can make you forget

17:44.020 --> 17:45.950
people and things related to love.

17:46.660 --> 17:47.900
From now on,

17:48.750 --> 17:50.880
your cultivation will be much easier.

17:52.420 --> 17:53.500
Didn't you say

17:54.420 --> 17:57.020
even the mind-clearing power of Xuan Ling Wood

17:57.340 --> 17:58.660
can't erase

17:59.380 --> 18:00.980
people's love?

18:02.740 --> 18:05.410
Xuan Ling Wood can only clear distracting thoughts.

18:05.410 --> 18:06.300
Phoenix Tears

18:07.180 --> 18:09.780
can make you forget all love related feelings.

18:10.050 --> 18:11.580
It's like a glass of water.

18:11.930 --> 18:13.340
If you got dust on it,

18:13.340 --> 18:15.140
Xuan Ling Wood only clears dust.

18:16.100 --> 18:17.100
The Phoenix Tears

18:18.140 --> 18:20.140
will pour out the whole cup of water.

18:26.900 --> 18:27.820
So,

18:29.100 --> 18:30.620
you want me to forget Lu Li

18:33.140 --> 18:35.270
and everything that happened before?

18:36.500 --> 18:37.900
Now that you don't remember,

18:37.900 --> 18:39.300
you want me to forget too?

18:39.740 --> 18:41.540
Just pretend it never happened?

18:41.780 --> 18:44.900
Mortal love will only disturb your cultivation, Liu Shao.

18:44.900 --> 18:46.160
It's better to forget.

18:46.260 --> 18:47.180
But I don't want to cultivate.

18:47.180 --> 18:48.780
I just want to be with you.

18:48.930 --> 18:51.260
This is the obsession you shouldn't have.

18:51.300 --> 18:52.960
You should have forgotten it.

18:53.060 --> 18:53.540
I...

18:56.060 --> 18:58.020
What happened between Lu Li and me

18:58.810 --> 19:01.260
were real.

19:01.820 --> 19:03.060
It's not dust,

19:03.410 --> 19:05.210
nor water that has been stained.

19:05.620 --> 19:07.620
Even if you're now Immortal Luo Ge,

19:09.060 --> 19:10.660
it doesn't change anything.

19:11.210 --> 19:12.140
I, Liu Shao,

19:14.780 --> 19:16.440
would rather die than forget.

19:27.420 --> 19:28.150
How dare you!

19:32.980 --> 19:33.540
Liu Shao.

19:34.090 --> 19:34.620
Liu Shao.

19:36.500 --> 19:37.220
Luo Ge.

19:38.530 --> 19:39.390
I won't forget.

19:40.380 --> 19:41.820
Never.

19:43.500 --> 19:45.430
It's OK if you don't want to forget.

19:45.820 --> 19:47.350
Leave the Immortal Palace.

19:47.660 --> 19:48.860
Leave Xiyin Mountain

19:49.620 --> 19:51.420
and return to your mortal world.

19:53.100 --> 19:53.620
No.

19:54.500 --> 19:55.970
You just forgot the past.

19:56.700 --> 19:57.740
You didn't forget

19:57.740 --> 19:59.200
our relationship, right?

19:59.580 --> 20:00.660
I can feel

20:02.540 --> 20:03.420
your heart

20:04.100 --> 20:05.360
still belongs to Lu Li.

20:06.620 --> 20:08.140
It has never changed.

20:09.620 --> 20:10.700
I won't be wrong.

20:12.020 --> 20:12.820
You're wrong.

20:13.940 --> 20:15.540
I'm devoted to cultivation.

20:15.980 --> 20:17.610
I don't have Lu Li's feelings.

20:17.610 --> 20:20.720
♫On rainy days, wind blows smoke♫

20:17.810 --> 20:18.500
You do.

20:20.130 --> 20:21.580
I heard Lu Li was attacked by the Soul-devouring Spell.

20:20.720 --> 20:22.810
♫Into circles♫

20:21.900 --> 20:23.560
It wasn't undone until death.

20:23.690 --> 20:24.460
Do I have it?

20:23.950 --> 20:26.800
♫On both sides, I'm chanting♫

20:27.100 --> 20:28.890
♫The night is sleepless♫

20:30.200 --> 20:33.220
♫The shadows of the moon are incomplete, and people are in love♫

20:33.350 --> 20:35.530
♫A cocoon of shadows♫

20:35.970 --> 20:41.340
♫Your promise, my fate♫

20:41.380 --> 20:42.920
How dare you offend the Immortal?

20:42.920 --> 20:46.130
♫In spring, seasons changed♫

20:46.140 --> 20:48.190
♫But my heart is still the same♫

20:48.290 --> 20:48.580
Ge.

20:48.580 --> 20:49.130
Luo Ge.

20:49.270 --> 20:52.350
♫Back to the sky, the clouds passing by♫

20:49.660 --> 20:50.260
Are you OK?

20:51.450 --> 20:52.350
Immortal Master.

20:52.350 --> 20:53.910
♫Is like the things we went through♫

20:53.260 --> 20:54.660
She has no evil thoughts.

20:55.560 --> 20:58.250
♫Beside the lake, on the boat♫

20:56.020 --> 20:57.480
No matter what she thinks,

20:58.060 --> 20:59.820
your spiritual powers will oppose each other.

20:58.640 --> 21:00.570
♫The moment we passed each other♫

21:00.180 --> 21:01.740
You will only hurt each other.

21:01.250 --> 21:06.970
♫Can compare with the rest of my life♫

21:01.820 --> 21:03.660
Do you want to harm others and yourself

21:03.660 --> 21:05.820
and make the three worlds hopeless?

21:07.060 --> 21:08.100
The spiritual powers are against each other.

21:07.350 --> 21:12.670
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

21:10.540 --> 21:11.100
No.

21:12.980 --> 21:14.700
Lu Li has been reborn as you.

21:13.630 --> 21:19.680
♫Looking at your ageless face at the end of the world♫

21:16.420 --> 21:19.280
Will the spiritual powers still oppose each other?

21:19.810 --> 21:22.180
Can't you see that his injuries are difficult to heal

21:20.080 --> 21:26.300
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can’t hear it♫

21:22.500 --> 21:24.030
and he's weaker and weaker?

21:25.780 --> 21:26.500
So,

21:26.300 --> 21:32.510
♫When the flowers stop falling, you and I will miss each other♫

21:27.860 --> 21:29.660
it's all because of me

21:31.180 --> 21:31.710
Liu Shao.

21:32.510 --> 21:37.430
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

21:33.180 --> 21:35.980
Don't struggle for the fact that can't be changed.

21:36.260 --> 21:38.540
It's better for you to forget everything.

21:38.540 --> 21:39.460
I won't forget.

21:38.810 --> 21:44.780
♫After the missing, my face is still young♫

21:40.060 --> 21:41.620
I will never forget it.

21:45.170 --> 21:51.180
♫The day the flowers fall in the garden, the day we meet♫

21:47.330 --> 21:49.060
I'll leave the Immortal Palace

21:50.780 --> 21:52.140
and never see you again.

21:51.470 --> 21:57.900
♫If you see me for the first time in this life, I'll forever hold it in my heart♫

21:53.580 --> 21:54.580
You understood?

21:55.700 --> 21:57.160
I don't understand at all.

21:58.530 --> 22:01.420
♫Get lost in your sky♫

21:58.860 --> 22:01.620
Why can't I be with the one I love?

22:01.650 --> 22:04.240
♫Whose wilderness♫

22:03.580 --> 22:04.660
But I also know

22:04.850 --> 22:09.620
♫Clouds billow up and fade away in the four seas♫

22:07.290 --> 22:08.300
if I do this,

22:09.660 --> 22:10.740
it will hurt him.

22:11.250 --> 22:14.290
♫The mountains and rivers after the farewell♫

22:12.820 --> 22:14.450
So I will leave and go far away.

22:14.290 --> 22:16.550
♫Silence♫

22:16.300 --> 22:18.260
I'll never see you again.

22:16.550 --> 22:19.030
♫Time sighs silently♫

22:19.030 --> 22:23.910
♫Whose passing years♫

22:21.900 --> 22:23.490
Since you've made up your mind,

22:23.490 --> 22:24.890
don't hesitate anymore.

22:25.170 --> 22:26.570
Go down the mountain now.

22:30.140 --> 22:31.140
Immortal Master.

22:31.500 --> 22:32.960
I have one more thing to do.

22:33.780 --> 22:34.780
Please

22:35.220 --> 22:37.140
allow me to stay in the Immortal Palace

22:37.140 --> 22:38.470
for another three days.

22:40.420 --> 22:41.020
Approved.

22:43.260 --> 22:43.820
Okay.

22:44.180 --> 22:46.000
You can stay in the Immortal Palace,

22:46.000 --> 22:48.600
but you can't come to the Xiyin Mountain again.

22:54.660 --> 22:59.980
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

22:59.820 --> 23:00.690
Immortal Master.

23:00.690 --> 23:02.100
Should I go and keep an eye on Liu Shao?

23:00.990 --> 23:06.980
♫Looking back at the love that still remains in your past life♫

23:02.370 --> 23:04.260
I'm afraid she'll find an excuse to go back to the Feiyuan House

23:04.260 --> 23:05.590
or ask Luo Ning for help.

23:06.300 --> 23:07.300
Keep an eye on her.

23:07.380 --> 23:13.610
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can’t hear it♫

23:07.700 --> 23:09.090
Don't let her come to the Xiyin Mountain again.

23:09.090 --> 23:09.620
Yes.

23:13.610 --> 23:19.810
♫When the flowers fall, you and I will miss each other♫

23:18.740 --> 23:19.700
Ge.

23:19.810 --> 23:25.340
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

23:20.260 --> 23:22.190
You didn't focus on recuperating,

23:22.330 --> 23:23.620
but you're making

23:23.900 --> 23:25.160
the Ice Spirit for her?

23:25.340 --> 23:27.060
Are you adding injuries to existing ones?

23:26.190 --> 23:32.160
♫Looking at your ageless face after deciding to spend the rest of our lives together♫

23:29.450 --> 23:32.550
It's not that I want to be the villain who breaks up the couple.

23:32.550 --> 23:38.560
♫The day the flowers fall in the garden, the day we meet♫

23:32.900 --> 23:34.090
Who is she?

23:35.140 --> 23:36.700
How can she be more important to you

23:36.700 --> 23:38.900
and the safety of this Immortal Palace?

23:38.970 --> 23:44.510
♫ The year of my life fleets♫

23:44.990 --> 23:53.850
♫Whose passing years♫

23:54.820 --> 23:55.260
Stop!

24:03.290 --> 24:03.980
Bai Feng.

24:05.340 --> 24:06.400
What are you doing?

24:06.580 --> 24:08.260
Immortal Master asked me to keep an eye on you

24:08.260 --> 24:10.740
and stop you from going to the Xiyin Mountain.

24:10.740 --> 24:12.140
I promised I wouldn't go.

24:12.940 --> 24:14.200
Of course I will not go.

24:14.340 --> 24:15.600
Who would believe you?

24:15.980 --> 24:17.860
With your feelings for Lu Li,

24:18.060 --> 24:20.790
you'll go to him even if your leg is broken, right?

24:34.220 --> 24:36.750
Senior's move is so brilliant and beautiful.

24:37.060 --> 24:38.340
Immortal Master ordered

24:38.340 --> 24:40.140
to expel her from Xiyin Mountain.

24:40.140 --> 24:41.870
Did he ask you to break her legs?

24:42.100 --> 24:42.740
How dare you

24:42.740 --> 24:45.220
misinterpret the order and take personal revenge?

24:45.220 --> 24:46.060
Master Zhuo.

24:46.260 --> 24:47.020
Liu Shao.

24:49.500 --> 24:51.060
Don't think I don't know

24:51.060 --> 24:52.340
what you did in the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

24:52.340 --> 24:53.740
Since you're here in the Immortal Palace,

24:53.740 --> 24:54.780
you'd better behave yourself.

24:54.780 --> 24:55.980
Stop fooling around.

24:56.180 --> 24:57.380
You're really something,

24:57.380 --> 24:58.440
just like Liu Shao.

24:58.660 --> 25:00.300
If you go to the Bone Melting Pool,

25:00.300 --> 25:01.220
I'll believe

25:01.460 --> 25:02.520
you are not a bitch.

25:02.940 --> 25:03.580
Get lost!

25:03.900 --> 25:06.230
Don't stand here and make my senior angry.

25:06.420 --> 25:07.020
Yes.

25:13.420 --> 25:14.750
Thank you, Master Zhuo.

25:14.900 --> 25:15.540
Shut up.

25:16.210 --> 25:17.490
I'm not doing this for you.

25:17.490 --> 25:19.150
It's for the Immortal Palace.

25:19.570 --> 25:20.100
Liu Shao.

25:20.410 --> 25:21.140
Are you okay?

25:21.540 --> 25:22.180
What?

25:22.500 --> 25:24.160
Do you want to stay to take care

25:24.340 --> 25:25.940
or take her back to serve her?

25:26.300 --> 25:26.980
I dare not.

25:27.340 --> 25:28.700
I'm going to find the Master now.

25:28.700 --> 25:29.760
He knows medicine.

26:12.300 --> 26:13.900
You look disappointed.

26:15.860 --> 26:16.780
A little.

26:17.220 --> 26:17.940
After all,

26:18.300 --> 26:19.760
I don't want to see you die.

26:21.020 --> 26:22.300
You are honest.

26:22.660 --> 26:24.390
You're not pretentious at all.

26:24.460 --> 26:25.020
I like it.

26:27.380 --> 26:28.930
So many people fancy me.

26:29.340 --> 26:30.900
I don't need you anymore.

26:31.250 --> 26:33.710
At least I can wait for your brother with you.

26:33.740 --> 26:35.020
I don't need you to wait with me.

26:35.020 --> 26:37.280
If I want to see him, I can see him anytime.

26:38.060 --> 26:39.320
Although he loves you,

26:39.340 --> 26:41.130
he doesn't belong to you.

26:43.940 --> 26:45.330
He belongs to the Immortal Palace.

26:45.330 --> 26:46.780
He belongs to the three worlds.

26:46.780 --> 26:48.020
Only this little

26:48.420 --> 26:49.340
belongs to you.

26:56.220 --> 26:58.140
You wonder if I understand you, right?

26:58.140 --> 26:59.860
When I came here last time,

27:00.100 --> 27:02.420
you seem to be good at craftsmanship.

27:04.100 --> 27:05.630
So I brought a craft with me.

27:11.980 --> 27:13.540
Don't give this ugly doll

27:13.540 --> 27:14.380
to me.

27:14.820 --> 27:15.820
This will ruin

27:15.980 --> 27:18.240
the feng shui of the Waterside Pavilion.

27:18.740 --> 27:19.820
I'm a prisoner.

27:20.060 --> 27:20.940
I have nothing.

27:21.420 --> 27:22.260
This doll

27:22.420 --> 27:23.750
is made from my clothes.

27:24.260 --> 27:25.450
It means everything

27:25.860 --> 27:26.700
came from me.

27:26.850 --> 27:27.310
Then...

27:27.860 --> 27:29.590
That makes me want it even less.

27:30.540 --> 27:31.260
In the past,

27:31.820 --> 27:33.750
I made an uglier one for my brother.

27:34.580 --> 27:35.780
He fought other clans

27:35.860 --> 27:37.060
on behalf of our clan.

27:37.300 --> 27:38.980
He left for three months.

27:39.700 --> 27:40.900
But when he came back,

27:41.820 --> 27:43.900
I found that he lost the doll I made.

27:44.170 --> 27:46.340
I was furious and unreasonable.

27:46.740 --> 27:49.060
I smashed everything I could break in his chamber.

27:49.060 --> 27:50.100
I even bit him.

27:50.450 --> 27:51.380
You're

27:51.500 --> 27:53.300
not good at making things.

27:53.780 --> 27:54.820
Well,

27:55.660 --> 27:57.100
it is quite interesting.

27:57.260 --> 27:58.020
Is it?

27:59.860 --> 28:00.900
Normally,

28:01.900 --> 28:03.630
people would say I'm immature.

28:04.780 --> 28:06.500
Since brothers are already so sensible,

28:06.500 --> 28:08.220
why should we be sensible?

28:10.940 --> 28:12.420
Why can't such a good brother

28:12.420 --> 28:14.010
only belong to me?

28:14.540 --> 28:16.870
Why should I share him with the whole clan?

28:18.340 --> 28:19.340
That makes sense.

28:20.620 --> 28:22.940
Why should my brother belong to the Immortal Palace?

28:22.940 --> 28:25.670
Why should my brother belong to the three worlds?

28:34.380 --> 28:35.300
Your story

28:35.500 --> 28:37.060
is quite nice.

28:38.350 --> 28:39.020
But

28:39.180 --> 28:41.580
this doll is really ugly.

28:43.100 --> 28:43.820
Fu.

28:44.540 --> 28:46.060
You tried so hard

28:46.180 --> 28:48.020
to please me with my brother.

28:49.140 --> 28:51.460
You're really full of schemes.

28:52.660 --> 28:54.320
If it can relieve loneliness,

28:54.860 --> 28:55.750
so what?

28:57.180 --> 28:57.980
You're right.

29:01.060 --> 29:02.590
How about I be your brother?

29:04.540 --> 29:05.900
I'm about

29:06.130 --> 29:08.820
1,000 years old this year.

29:09.690 --> 29:12.300
General of Water,

29:12.340 --> 29:13.860
how old are you?

29:14.020 --> 29:15.020
I'm almost 1,000 years old.

29:15.020 --> 29:16.300
Almost 1,000 years old?

29:16.300 --> 29:18.430
That means you're not 1,000 years old.

29:18.500 --> 29:19.300
Call me older sister.

29:19.300 --> 29:20.100
Older sister.

29:23.220 --> 29:24.140
I still think

29:24.460 --> 29:26.720
the title Little Fairy suits you better.

29:27.940 --> 29:29.660
Little Fairy?

29:32.060 --> 29:33.020
Alright then.

29:34.460 --> 29:35.420
I...

29:36.780 --> 29:38.140
I'll call you Fu.

29:38.820 --> 29:39.300
OK.

29:41.940 --> 29:42.660
Fu.

29:42.980 --> 29:44.460
You want to lie to me

29:44.700 --> 29:46.300
and you want to be my brother,

29:46.300 --> 29:47.260
then you must

29:47.580 --> 29:49.580
agree with me in everything, right?

29:52.140 --> 29:54.340
Well, you may put it this way.

30:15.100 --> 30:16.900
You went out fine,

30:17.420 --> 30:19.150
why did you come back like this?

30:19.940 --> 30:20.380
No.

30:21.540 --> 30:22.740
Where else can you go?

30:23.300 --> 30:25.430
You don't even have a place to stay now.

30:26.060 --> 30:26.700
Yes.

30:27.940 --> 30:29.700
I've been chasing

30:30.610 --> 30:31.380
and chasing.

30:32.580 --> 30:34.940
I just want to be happy with him

30:36.180 --> 30:38.660
and want us to be an ordinary couple.

30:41.060 --> 30:42.590
Even if we can't be a couple,

30:43.380 --> 30:45.090
as long as we can see each other

30:46.220 --> 30:48.300
and accompany each other in the Immortal Palace,

30:48.300 --> 30:49.700
I would still feel happy.

30:51.750 --> 30:52.250
But

30:53.500 --> 30:54.620
it was impossible

30:56.420 --> 30:57.550
from the beginning.

30:59.260 --> 31:00.260
It was a wild wish

31:02.460 --> 31:03.590
from the beginning.

31:05.820 --> 31:08.480
I thought you and Lu Li would never be separated.

31:09.780 --> 31:11.980
Why were you separated again and again?

31:13.380 --> 31:14.260
They said

31:16.210 --> 31:18.470
our spiritual powers oppose each other.

31:18.700 --> 31:19.830
If we stay together,

31:21.220 --> 31:22.150
it will hurt him.

31:23.770 --> 31:24.970
Don't listen to them.

31:25.780 --> 31:27.580
The herbs that oppose each other

31:27.580 --> 31:28.740
grow good together.

31:33.140 --> 31:34.020
I don't know.

31:36.700 --> 31:37.300
But

31:39.260 --> 31:40.740
as long as Luo Ge is fine,

31:42.500 --> 31:43.700
I can do anything.

31:53.340 --> 31:54.020
Master,

31:55.340 --> 31:57.740
can you give me the seed of Weirui Grass?

32:02.620 --> 32:03.880
What do you want it for?

32:08.380 --> 32:09.640
I want Luo Ge to be well.

32:31.580 --> 32:32.050
Master.

32:32.420 --> 32:34.140
This demon energy is made from

32:34.260 --> 32:36.720
an Aquatic Demon baby born less than an hour.

32:36.900 --> 32:38.060
If Master uses this,

32:38.180 --> 32:40.710
your power will progress by leaps and bounds.

32:40.860 --> 32:43.320
Who allowed you to touch the Aquatic Demons?

32:44.260 --> 32:45.460
Do you want to die?

33:03.860 --> 33:05.590
The Demon King in White is here.

33:20.170 --> 33:21.450
Listen up, demons!

33:22.100 --> 33:23.360
For hundreds of years,

33:23.540 --> 33:25.540
we demons have been unorganized

33:26.140 --> 33:27.330
and fought against each other.

33:27.330 --> 33:29.340
We were despised in the three worlds.

33:29.340 --> 33:29.900
Today,

33:30.690 --> 33:32.140
I swear

33:32.660 --> 33:33.980
to change everything.

33:34.340 --> 33:35.300
From now on,

33:36.140 --> 33:37.540
as long as you are a demon,

33:37.660 --> 33:40.020
as long as you're in the territory of demons,

33:40.020 --> 33:42.620
you have to treat me, He Na in white, as the king.

33:43.020 --> 33:44.550
You have to follow my orders

33:44.780 --> 33:46.440
for everything you say and do.

33:46.700 --> 33:48.300
If you have a second opinion,

33:48.940 --> 33:49.900
come forward.

33:51.550 --> 33:52.860
Greetings, Demon King He Na.

33:52.860 --> 33:54.420
We will be loyal

33:54.700 --> 33:55.780
and follow you.

33:56.820 --> 33:57.780
One more thing.

34:14.340 --> 34:14.940
Remember.

34:16.139 --> 34:17.900
My first rule is

34:18.300 --> 34:19.699
those who kill children,

34:20.100 --> 34:22.900
regardless of race or whether an enemy or a friend,

34:23.380 --> 34:24.580
will be killed.

34:26.260 --> 34:28.540
Yes, Your Majesty.

34:37.130 --> 34:38.340
[Meditation Spell]

34:39.179 --> 34:40.239
Meditation Spell?

34:41.900 --> 34:42.940
My brother

34:43.179 --> 34:45.020
has cast a spell on these books.

34:45.420 --> 34:47.219
These words will only disappear

34:47.420 --> 34:50.020
after people recite and memorise

34:50.540 --> 34:52.380
all the contents in the book.

34:52.820 --> 34:53.900
You like me so much.

34:54.620 --> 34:55.739
You should be willing to

34:55.739 --> 34:57.890
help me finish my homework this month.

34:59.220 --> 34:59.900
What?

35:00.180 --> 35:01.180
You don't want to?

35:01.220 --> 35:01.880
I will do it.

35:02.340 --> 35:04.200
Of course I'm willing to help you.

35:05.860 --> 35:07.060
I just want to ask you.

35:07.620 --> 35:08.820
How many days are left

35:08.860 --> 35:09.660
in this month?

35:26.020 --> 35:26.940
Good boy.

36:44.620 --> 36:46.820
Recite it carefully. Do you hear me?

36:47.060 --> 36:48.020
Yes.

37:05.540 --> 37:07.020
Not bad.

37:07.860 --> 37:08.980
Fu

37:09.220 --> 37:10.780
is really a material.

37:11.460 --> 37:13.700
My homework for next month is coming.

37:14.500 --> 37:15.700
I

37:15.940 --> 37:17.900
need such a talent.

37:24.820 --> 37:25.900
This is ugly.

37:29.700 --> 37:30.690
But...

37:31.100 --> 37:32.780
he has finished

37:32.780 --> 37:34.020
all your homework.

37:34.180 --> 37:35.300
That's a lot.

37:43.260 --> 37:44.130
But

37:44.900 --> 37:45.980
it's still ugly.

37:53.300 --> 37:54.700
Much better now.

38:15.850 --> 38:17.540
It seems that

38:17.660 --> 38:18.940
Fu had a good time

38:18.980 --> 38:20.300
with Fairy Luo Ning.

38:21.300 --> 38:22.500
Have you found

38:23.380 --> 38:24.620
what I asked you to find?

38:24.620 --> 38:26.370
I've checked all the things

38:26.540 --> 38:27.580
Master left.

38:28.620 --> 38:30.100
There is no formation

38:30.420 --> 38:33.020
that can break the barrier set by the Immortal.

38:39.060 --> 38:40.180
As I expected,

38:40.820 --> 38:42.300
I have to take the risk now.

38:43.820 --> 38:46.060
Every time I pass the Waterside Pavilion for Reflections,

38:46.060 --> 38:47.860
I would leave more water energy.

38:48.380 --> 38:50.100
When the water energy is enough,

38:50.100 --> 38:52.340
I will use my body to summon my spirit.

38:52.740 --> 38:54.930
If the spirit breaks the barrier by force,

38:54.930 --> 38:55.980
it will break.

38:56.820 --> 38:58.420
You'll die a horrible death.

39:00.740 --> 39:04.470
It's said that on the day when the Bone-Corroding Harp reappeared,

39:04.820 --> 39:05.740
a star

39:06.740 --> 39:08.070
went straight to the sky

39:08.780 --> 39:10.220
and fell on Luo Ning.

39:11.660 --> 39:12.460
So?

39:14.380 --> 39:15.540
That's not a star.

39:16.860 --> 39:19.510
It's the remaining spiritual power left by the Bone-Corroding Harp.

39:19.510 --> 39:20.970
It returned to the master.

39:21.850 --> 39:22.940
What do you mean?

39:23.560 --> 39:26.280
Luo Ning is the disciple of Immortal Ze Shui.

39:27.930 --> 39:29.590
Just like the spirit of the Sun

39:29.710 --> 39:31.420
fell on Liu Shao.

39:32.850 --> 39:34.850
While the immortal energy of Ze Shui

39:34.860 --> 39:36.380
fell on Luo Ning.

39:36.960 --> 39:39.580
Luo Ge should have known about this long ago.

39:39.960 --> 39:42.820
He was afraid that his sister would be affected by Ze Shui's hatred.

39:42.820 --> 39:45.740
So he asked her to copy scriptures since she was young

39:45.740 --> 39:46.700
to calm her mind.

39:47.830 --> 39:49.220
It is said the Bone-Corroding Harp

39:49.220 --> 39:50.700
can heal all wounds.

39:51.000 --> 39:52.500
So I want to take a risk.

39:53.440 --> 39:54.540
She can save me.

39:56.650 --> 39:57.860
She will save me.

39:58.900 --> 39:59.780
I hope so.

40:03.820 --> 40:06.460
As long as I can collect her heart.

40:07.700 --> 40:08.660
The problem is

40:09.620 --> 40:11.020
the Little Fairy's heart

40:13.020 --> 40:14.170
is hard to collect.

40:31.580 --> 40:33.340
The seclusion did you well.

40:33.620 --> 40:35.380
You look much better.

40:37.580 --> 40:39.060
I was injured a while ago

40:39.460 --> 40:40.850
and recuperated for a few days.

40:40.850 --> 40:41.980
It's not seclusion.

40:47.620 --> 40:48.300
Tell me.

40:48.660 --> 40:50.060
Why did you want to see me?

40:53.820 --> 40:54.740
I never drink.

40:56.140 --> 40:56.700
Really?

40:57.540 --> 40:58.940
I've never drunk before.

41:00.300 --> 41:01.380
You dare not face it

41:02.500 --> 41:03.740
or drink this wine.

41:04.460 --> 41:05.260
You're afraid that after drinking it,

41:05.260 --> 41:06.660
you'll behave like Lu Li.

41:12.350 --> 41:13.180
That's right.

41:13.740 --> 41:14.140
Here.

41:18.180 --> 41:18.860
How is she?

41:20.420 --> 41:20.900
Who?

41:21.380 --> 41:22.780
She? Who?

41:25.700 --> 41:26.830
You know the answer.

41:28.860 --> 41:31.020
You didn't allow her to stay in Xiyin Mountain.

41:31.020 --> 41:32.880
So I asked Master to take her away.

41:33.700 --> 41:35.460
I don't know where she is now.

41:36.220 --> 41:36.740
But,

41:36.860 --> 41:38.220
Master will take good care of her.
